# Quality exceptions for {{ project_name }}

No exception is granted by this seed. This project-owned document is preserved
by ordinary template updates. Every requested exception must also appear in
`.engineering-backbone/quality-profile.json` using its exact supported fields.

For each permitted exception record its rule ID, affected scope, concrete reason,
responsible owner, approving human, approval evidence, expiry and compensating
measure. Preserve decision and renewal history. Missing approval, expired or
non-exceptionable rules remain blocking; this record does not authenticate approval.
